(17, 'Static Web Designing', 17, 'Static-Web-Designing', '<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">To explain the things in the most unfussy manner,&nbsp;static website design&nbsp;is the simplest method to show your business online to the entire globe. Nevertheless expert knowledge is a must have to show this simple data to the populace of the world.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Layouts of the page can be altered in the most uncomplicated way. Also, one good thing about the website is the easy download of image, brochures and other related data. It helps spawn fair amount of inquires for future business.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">A professional website produced creates a stunning view and thus magnetizes inquiries. It is the simplest website for hosting. Minimum script requirement and HTML coding helps build the entire site</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Being a leading&nbsp;<strong>website designing company based in Delhi NCR</strong>, we thrive to combine awareness and innovative ideas to fabricate gratified domino effect at the closing stages. Package for static website design studio allows individual folks or mammoth companies to float their simple information onto the pages.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">As a part of&nbsp;static web designing services Delhi NCR, we, at Perfect Web Experts have art of turning the simplest form of website in the most marvelous form that exerts a pull on the vigorous search carried out on the search engines for the related products</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">We provide static web content with appropriate keywords which gets your website top ranking in major search engines</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Basic web programming knowledge from the best connoisseurs of the country</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">We help custom design the website along with the personalized logo</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Verification of the meta tag</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Along with meta tag, we also provide verification for site</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Apart from designing the site, our expert heads slog hard to give their unsurpassed. To ensure the site works well and yields the fruit as expected by the clients, we give our top by functioning solidly behind the scenes.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">To get top service from top-notch professionals and renowned company, why not request a quote today!</span></p>', '1606985641.png', 'Static website designing| Static Website Designing Company in Delhi', 'Perfect Web Experts is one of the best Static Web Designing Company in India, we offers static website designing services in Delhi, India.', 'Static website designing Delhi, Static Website Designing India, Static Website Designing company in Delhi, Static Website Designing Company in India, Website Designing in Delhi, Static website development in India, Static Website Development In Delhi, Static Website Designing Company, Static Website Designing, Static web Design Services, Static web Design Services in India, Static web Design Services in Delhi, Static web Design,  Static web pages, Top static website designing company', 'no', 'yes', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'enable', '2020-09-15 01:37:09.000000', '2020-12-03 13:30:42.000000'),
(20, 'Responsive Web Designing', 17, 'Responsive-Web-Designing', NULL, '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Responsive&nbsp;</span>design is the approach that makes website flexible to deliver an optimal view to users on mobile and web platforms. Making a website is the very simple approach, but making with responsive feature needs efforts and the knowledge of the latest technology.&nbsp;Responsive web designing company in Delhi NCR&nbsp;is an award-winning service provider, who not only incorporate responsive design on your new website but also update the responsive feature in the existing website. Our&nbsp;responsive website&nbsp; design services&nbsp;provide cost-effective and flat-out-effective ways to reach customers, connect with business partners, and stay in touch with co-workers hassle free.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Core Concept on which the&nbsp;responsive website designing&nbsp;work are:</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Responsive design uses a flexible approach to website layout, fonts, and image to adapt on the different screens on different platforms.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Minimize loss of resolutions on oversized monitors.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Dynamic flexibility feature allows websites to any size of screens.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">A responsive design website will make your business more compatible with today&#39;s and tomorrow technologies.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">If you seeking for the responsive website, our talented web designers can update your simple website into a responsive website that delivers outstanding interface to the users. With, perfect web experts as your responsive website company, you can rest assured that you will get the website that easily gets the online presence and convert your traffic into a sale.</span></span></p>', '1606985855.png', 'Responsive Web Designing | Responsive Website Designing Company Delhi', 'Responsive Website Designing  is one of the hottest trends due to the growth of smart phones and mobile devices. Almost every new clients these days wants a mobile version of their website.', 'Responsive Website Designing, Responsive Website Designing Delhi, Responsive Website Designing India, Responsive Website Designing Company in Delhi, Responsive Website Designing Company in India, Responsive web Designing, Responsive web Designing Delhi, Responsive web Designing India, Responsive Website Development, Responsive Website Development Delhi, Responsive Web Development India, Responsive Web Designing Services, Responsive Web Designing Services Delhi, Responsive Web Designing Services India, Top Responsive Website Designing Company, Top Responsive Web Designing Company India, Top Responsive website Designing Company Delhi,', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'enable', '2020-11-17 16:08:00.000000', '2020-12-03 13:32:17.000000'),
(21, 'Custom Website Designing', 17, 'Custom-Website-Designing', NULL, '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Custom web designing&nbsp;is an important factor that uses for expressing the brand&rsquo;s personality. It is much more than color, font, and images. In simple words, it is the process of learning and understanding of the business. Every aspect of your website builds in this way that reflects your business value and behavior of working culture and products and services. Our&nbsp;web design team&nbsp;build your website with a simplicity that aesthetically pleasing to your customers like they use understandable labels, use fonts that are readable, tone and word should always be simple and attention on your company&rsquo;s logo, name, and picture.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Technology skilled developers at Perfect web experts, don&rsquo;t believe in implementing conventional and traditional approaches, they always use the latest technology to make your website engaging, unique and creative that easily convert your customers into revenue.&nbsp; Web developers of perfect web experts are well aware of the fact that by adding different colors and theme, it&rsquo;s difficult for the company to attract customers. They have to add some unique customized features with the right creative elements that take the website out of the crowd. After understanding the client&rsquo;s expectations and his business profile, we create custom websites that accommodate the essentials elements required to make your business more appealing and engaging.&nbsp;</span></span></p>', '1606985972.jpg', 'Custom Website Designing, Custom Web Designing Services in Delhi, India', 'Perfect Web Experts provides all kinds of Custom Web Design Services like ecommerces, ERP, CRM, Internet Marketing, we are the top Customized Website Designing Company.', 'Custom Website Design, Custom Website Design Delhi, Custom Website Design India, Custom website designing company, custom website designing company in Delhi, custom website designing company in India, custom web design, custom web design India, custom web design Delhi, professional custom web designing company, custom web solution, custom web design firm, custom web design company, custom web design company in Delhi, custom web design design company in India, customized web designing company, customized web designing company in Delhi, customized web designing company in India, custom website development, custom website development Delhi, custom website development India, custom website design services, custom website design services in Delhi, custom website design services India,', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'enable', '2020-11-17 16:08:59.000000', '2020-12-03 13:46:45.000000'),
