(44, 'OS Commerce Customization', 18, 'OS-Commerce-Customization', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Os commerce&nbsp;is an online store management program that offers businesses customization and inexpensive option for launching an online store. Our passionate and talented team have experience in developing new ways to make the online store more effective so that your online sale easily rise to the new heights.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">OS Commerce is an online e-store management software. It is a self-hosted platform. It can take care of front end store catalog, your product, and you back- end management tasks.&nbsp;OS Commerce platform&nbsp;is open source, which means it allows you to modify without worrying that you are volatile some license agreement. If you have a business and looking to expand on the online platform than&nbsp;OS Commerce platform&nbsp;is good to get started with.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Features of OS Commerce:</span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Product catalog management. You can have an unlimited number of products, product categories, manufacturers, product attributes.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Special offers.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Reviews.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Customer management.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Currency and language settings.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Tax handling.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Extension possibility through modules.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Orders processing.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Reports.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Advanced tools (like banner control, cache control, database backups, security checks, and more).</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Why you need an Expert help?</span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Though OS Commerce is ain&#39;t a difficult platform, you can manage effortlessly and grasped every feature very quickly. Still, while installation and customization you need expert help. Being experienced with OS Commerce customization and development, we thoroughly perceive the architecture behind the OS E-Commerce search engine. This helps us to tailor-made the e-store as per your business 