(56, 'On Page And Off Page SEO', 19, 'On-Page-And-Off-Page-SEO', NULL, '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;Off page and on page both SEO services&nbsp;are extremely useful when it comes to improving better results in&nbsp;search engine ranking. Gone are the days when web owners use traditional techniques to achieve on Google, Bing, and Yahoo. Now, do it right, adapt trending SEO techniques that grow your business and build your brand. The perfect web experts offer you the most cost-effective SEO techniques that successfully driving the right traffic to your website.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">On Page SEO: It is one of the most preferable SEO technique that use to increase the level of the website. From the keyword optimization, descriptive meta tag, adding alt text for images, link optimization, and web content, our professionals will do everything in order to maintain good search engine ranking.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Off Page SEO: This type of SEO involves promoting the website via social media marketing, social bookmarking and link building. We provide you personalized off-page SEO strategies that keep your level up on the search engine page.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Why choose us?</span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">The perfect web experts digital marketing team will provide you both on the page and off page techniques.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=