(63, 'Yii 2 Framework', 16, 'Yii-2-Framework', NULL, '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Apart from attractive and rich-features, security is a crucial part of any&nbsp;web application&nbsp;and Yii 2 framework comes with a security application components that serve numerous methods to developers in creating robust and more secure web applications.&nbsp;Yii is an MVC framework&nbsp;that is optimized for high performance, give security to the application and support a greater amount of database. The flexibility is a good thing for the developers and Yii gives them the freedom to be creative. If the development speed, flexibility, and security are the top priorities of the clients then Yii web application development is the most preferred PHP framework.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Some key Features include:</span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Database Access Object and Active Records.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Model- view- controller.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Integration with JQuery.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">From input and Validation.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Web 2.0 widget.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span 