(78, 'E-Commerce Application', 20, 'E-Commerce-Application', NULL, '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">There are many motivational reasons to use&nbsp;e-commerce solutions in the business&nbsp;because of this single medium you can sell all your products hassle-free and manage your data as well. We understand, every&nbsp;e-commerce business&nbsp;is unique and has different technological requirements depending on the product and services. We are well versed in developing high-quality&nbsp;E-commerce applications&nbsp;that perfectly matches with your requirements. Our E-Commerce applications range from the strategizing to implementations and ensuring quick and robust solutions.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Benefits of E-Commerce Applications:</span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">An E-Commerce application gives you opportunities to sell the products across the globe.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">An E-commerce application builds your online presence and increases your sales.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">An E-commerce application gives your customer&rsquo;s opportunity to access your store round the clock.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">An E-commerce application offers instant payment gateway options and maintains all database.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><span styl