(2, 'Rajan Mahajan', 'Rajan-Mahajan', '<p>I contacted <strong>&nbsp;AGNELIO &amp; SONS&nbsp;</strong> for AC gas refilling he came within an hour of calling. He and his technician did the job safely. He was polite to talk to and charged a reasonable price. After the work he cleaned all the mess. I really like his nature and work ethics. Need more guys like him in work as most of the people do fraud. I wish him all the best for his future work.</p>', '1615664291.jpg', NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, 'enable', '2020-09-12 04:22:26.000000', '2021-03-14 12:13:33.000000'),
(18, 'Dhiraj Malhotra', 'Dhiraj-Malhotra', '<p>He did a great job in fixing by single door freeze. It got into problem due to the use of knife to defreeze the ice from the freezer section. <strong>&nbsp;AGNELIO &amp; SONS</strong>&nbsp;provide best technicians&nbsp;who personally repaired and fixed the issue, when I re-reported the occurrence. Till now it&#39;s working fine, great. The Best Service... I am Happy !!</p>', '1615744314.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'enable', '2021-03-13 14:14:22.000000', '2021-03-14 12:21:54.000000');

